abstract: "Comparative models of automated-vehicle deployment governance — layered regulatory normalisation (N0–N4), post-type-approval deployment models (Second Gate) and human roles — published as coded, provenance-tracked datasets at dated snapshots from the ROAT Intelligence Hub."
